  "brain_first": "“对话只负责推动故事，不负责凑字数。”",
  "sort_order": 1067,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2719
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "人物需要交流信息、道歉、感谢、提出办法。",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2720
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2721
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Dialogue should reveal intention or move action",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2722
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "forward.",
      "sourcePage": 101,
      "sourceIndex": 2723
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “对话只负责推动故事，不负责凑字数。”",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2724
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 续写中长对话会挤压情节，而且容易标点/时态出错。",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2725
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2726
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 只保留必须说出来的信息。",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2727
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 一句对话后跟一个动作或反应。",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2728
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 同一人物连续多句可以合并。",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2729
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 避免重复原文已经知道的信息。",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2730
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 在空旁标词性 V/N/Adj/Adv；故事题用箭头记情绪/动作，如",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2731
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "worried→help→relieved；难空先打 ? 继续。",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2732
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2733
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· “Let me help,” he said, reaching for the box.",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2734
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· “I found it near the gate,” she explained.",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2735
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 删掉这句对话后故事会少一个必要信息或人物选择。",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2736
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 不知道复杂引语标点时，使用简短直接引语+said/asked。",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2737
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2738
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“Take my seat,” the boy said, stepping aside. The old man looked surprised, then thanked him",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2739
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "quietly.",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2740
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2741
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把整段写成聊天记录。",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2742
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 对话只重复情绪。",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2743
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2744
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 推动情节了吗？",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2745
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 人物说话符合身份吗？",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2746
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： C-P 词性错｜C-X 搭配错｜C-R 复现没发现",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2747
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜C-E 情绪线错｜C-S 故事情节逻辑错。",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2748
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 102,
      "sourceIndex": 2749
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 对话短一点，让它推动故事。",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2750
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2752
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 对话占满整段的问题？",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2753
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 对话最重要功能？",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2754
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 一句对话后最好配？",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2755
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 不熟复杂标点时怎么办？",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2756
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 每句都引号是否必要？",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2757
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 挤掉动作、情节和衔接。；2. 推动情节/揭示信息/反应情绪。；3. 动作或反应。；4. 少写长对话，保",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2758
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "持简单准确。；5. 不必要。",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2759
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— CW4 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“CW4”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 103,
      "sourceIndex": 2760
    }
  ],
